  "prefLabel": "Plc 211.10 Consideration of Waiver Requests by the Executive Director",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 211.10 Consideration of Waiver Requests by the Executive Director. For any proceeding where the board is an advisory board, if the executive director determines that the technical expertise of the advisory board is needed to respond to a petition for a waiver, the executive director shall consult with the advisory board prior to making a decision on the request.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 200) #13427, eff 8-4-22; ss by #13837, eff 12-28-23 (formerly Plc 211.02(e)) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 200)",
